WEBVTT

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.496
Sad, ako sedite tu u publici i govorite:

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.936
"Ah, da, pa, to nisam ja
i ne nasedam na to",

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.256
onda dođite na moj čas -

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.976
(Smeh)

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.680
kako bih vam pokazao koliko novca
vas svaki put košta vaša emotivnost.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:45.120
(Aplauz)

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:49.136
Mnogo vam hvala. Hvala vam.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.320
(Aplauz)